# A stage0 sample: an arithmetic loop. It prints the squares of 1 to `limit`
# (1, 4, 9, 16, 25), one per line, from a `while` loop bounded by the module
# constant `limit`, and exits with code 0.

squares is module
squares purpose "Print the squares of the whole numbers from 1 to a limit"
squares path squares
squares imports standard.console
squares imports standard.math
squares imports standard.compare
squares exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

limit is constant
limit purpose "The last number whose square is printed"
limit type Int64
limit value 5

main is operation
main purpose "Print the square of each whole number from 1 to the limit"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memoryHeap false
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label nextSquare note "Each pass prints one square; the loop returns to its header once per number"
main label nextSquare loopKind while
main label nextSquare within none
main label nextSquare maxIterations limit
main label printSquare loopKind none
main label printSquare within nextSquare
main label advance loopKind none
main label advance within nextSquare
main label finished loopKind none
main label finished within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let number Int64 1 mutable
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main let failCode ExitCode 1 immutable
main at begin goto nextSquare
main at nextSquare do pastLimitCheck
main at nextSquare branch if pastLimit goto finished else goto printSquare
main at printSquare do square
main at printSquare do printIt
main at printSquare branch ifError printIt goto failed else goto advance
main at advance do addOne
main at advance set number nextNumber
main at advance goto nextSquare
main at finished return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

pastLimitCheck is call
pastLimitCheck in main
pastLimitCheck invokes compare.greaterThanInt64
pastLimitCheck argument left Int64 number copy
pastLimitCheck argument right Int64 limit copy
pastLimitCheck result pastLimit Bool
pastLimitCheck ownedBy none
pastLimitCheck cleanedBy none
pastLimitCheck borrows none
pastLimitCheck catch none
pastLimitCheck suppresses none

square is call
square in main
square invokes math.multiplyInt64
square argument left Int64 number copy
square argument right Int64 number copy
square result squared Int64
square ownedBy none
square cleanedBy none
square borrows none
square catch none
square suppresses none

printIt is call
printIt in main
printIt invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printIt argument value Int64 squared copy
printIt result none
printIt ownedBy none
printIt cleanedBy none
printIt borrows none
printIt catch printError console.WriteError
printIt suppresses none

addOne is call
addOne in main
addOne invokes math.addInt64
addOne argument left Int64 number copy
addOne argument right Int64 one copy
addOne result nextNumber Int64
addOne ownedBy none
addOne cleanedBy none
addOne borrows none
addOne catch none
addOne suppresses none
